	(paper "A2")
	(title_block
		(title "GPSDO front end for PYNQ-Z2 - index")
		(rev "A")
		(company "Harvey Mudd College")
		(comment 1 "13 x 10 MHz DDMTD + 12 x 1 pps into the Raspberry Pi header")
	)
	(lib_symbols

	)
	(text "GPSDO-PYNQ-Z2   Digital DMTD front-end board"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.3200 25.4000 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 5.0000 5.0000)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0e3cc709-9b1f-c55e-046f-96c5707b9227")
	)
	(text "13 x 10 MHz DDMTD channels (12 GPSDOs + 1 null) and 12 x 1 pps channels, into the PYNQ-Z2's 40-pin Raspberry Pi header."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.3200 33.0200 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0000 2.0000)
				(italic yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0cfcacdf-a64f-2572-8255-2c793c6140a7")
	)
	(text_box "HOW THIS BOARD WORKS\n\nEach 10 MHz reference is terminated, AC-coupled and squared by a self-biased 74LVC1GU04, then SAMPLED ON THIS BOARD by a flip-flop clocked from a helper at 10.0012 MHz.  The flip-flop output is a ~1234 Hz beat whose edge times carry the input phase magnified by N = 8101, so a 12.3 ps input step becomes a full helper period at the FPGA.\n\nSampling on this board rather than in the FPGA is the one architectural choice worth knowing: it keeps thirteen 10 MHz edges off a 2.54 mm header, and it means the FPGA's input threshold drift enters divided by N instead of at full scale."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.3200 40.6400 0)
		(size 250.1900 62.2300)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 194 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8000 1.8000)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "20253d1f-364f-07f1-1d8f-1e8e04b26ec0")
	)
	(text_box "KEY NUMBERS\n\nf_signal   10.000000 MHz\nf_helper   10.0012344 MHz   (Si5351A CLK0, integer MultiSynth)\nf_beat     1234.4 Hz\nN          8101      single-shot resolution 12.3 ps\ntau_0      810.1 us per beat cycle\n\nThe FPGA measures f_beat every epoch, so N is a count divided by a count and the helper's absolute frequency never enters the result."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 279.4000 40.6400 0)
		(size 289.5600 62.2300)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 194 1)
		)
		(effects
